{"id":"83345981d6558f8e","group":"91","path":"91/91-df-adequacy-conditions.md","title":"基础去引号充分性与 Convention T 两条要求","display":"df-adequacy-conditions — 基础去引号充分性与 Convention T 两条要求","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth","book_abbrev":"91","label":"91-df-adequacy-conditions","aliases":["91-df-adequacy-conditions","91-df-tarski-adequacy"],"display":"df-adequacy-conditions — 基础去引号充分性与 Convention T 两条要求","depends_on":["[[91-df-T-schema]]","[[91-df-coded-syntax]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"91"},{"key":"label","html":"91-df-adequacy-conditions"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>91-df-adequacy-conditions</span><span>91-df-tarski-adequacy</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-adequacy-conditions — 基础去引号充分性与 Convention T 两条要求"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"ba367ff1b4bb3da3\" href=\"?note=ba367ff1b4bb3da3\" title=\"91-df-T-schema\">91-df-T-schema</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"38c875c58a0bf84c\" href=\"?note=38c875c58a0bf84c\" title=\"91-df-coded-syntax\">91-df-coded-syntax</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span> 是基础理论，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U\">\\(U\\)</span> 是包含 S 的经典真理扩张，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal L_0\\subseteq\\mathcal L_T\">\\(\\mathcal L_0\\subseteq\\mathcal L_T\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D_0(a)\">\\(D_0(a)\\)</span> 为基础句子编码谓词。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Adeq}(U,S,\\mathcal L_0)\">\\(\\operatorname{Adeq}(U,S,\\mathcal L_0)\\)</span> 是下述本地逐句充分性；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ConvT}_0(U,T)\">\\(\\operatorname{ConvT}_0(U,T)\\)</span> 是包含域要求的算术化简称。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}adequacy\\text{-}conditions}\\vdash\\quad\n\\operatorname{Adeq}(U,S,\\mathcal L_0)\\coloneqq S\\subseteq U\\land\n\\forall\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_0}\\;[U\\vdash T(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner})\\leftrightarrow\\varphi].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}adequacy\\text{-}conditions}\\vdash\\quad\n\\operatorname{Adeq}(U,S,\\mathcal L_0)\\coloneqq S\\subseteq U\\land\n\\forall\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_0}\\;[U\\vdash T(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner})\\leftrightarrow\\varphi].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ConvT}_0(U,T)\\coloneqq\n\\forall\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_0}\\;[U\\vdash T(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner})\\leftrightarrow\\varphi]\n\\land[U\\vdash\\forall a(Ta\\to D_0(a))].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{ConvT}_0(U,T)\\coloneqq\n\\forall\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_0}\\;[U\\vdash T(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner})\\leftrightarrow\\varphi]\n\\land[U\\vdash\\forall a(Ta\\to D_0(a))].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原书 Chapter 3 引述 Convention T：α 是元语言中所有翻译双条件，β 是真理外延只含目标语言句子。这里对象语言包含于元语言，翻译取包含映射，再以数码作名称，是明确的算术化特例。\n旧 Adeq 只对应逐句条件，不应称为完整 Convention T；TB 的模式不约束基础句子外的 T，因此未必满足附加域条件。Convention T 原来评价形式正确的显式定义，本目录的理论充分性是推广约定。\n保守性、可靠性、反射和一致性均另行论证，不能从充分性定义中读出。</p>\n<p>来源：Chapter 3，印刷页 15–17，PDF 页 26–28；Definition 8.1。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"91-df-T-schema","status":"resolved","id":"ba367ff1b4bb3da3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-T-schema]]","embed":false},{"target":"91-df-coded-syntax","status":"resolved","id":"38c875c58a0bf84c","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-coded-syntax]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"S","display":false},{"tex":"U","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal L_0\\subseteq\\mathcal L_T","display":false},{"tex":"D_0(a)","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Adeq}(U,S,\\mathcal L_0)","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{ConvT}_0(U,T)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}adequacy\\text{-}conditions}\\vdash\\quad\n\\operatorname{Adeq}(U,S,\\mathcal L_0)\\coloneqq S\\subseteq U\\land\n\\forall\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_0}\\;[U\\vdash T(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner})\\leftrightarrow\\varphi].","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{ConvT}_0(U,T)\\coloneqq\n\\forall\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_0}\\;[U\\vdash T(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner})\\leftrightarrow\\varphi]\n\\land[U\\vdash\\forall a(Ta\\to D_0(a))].","display":true}],"bytes":1892,"backlinks":[{"id":"58c35051f3ea09e6","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"967c10482b90bea3","anchor":"ref-55","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[91-df-adequacy-conditions]]"},{"id":"4278731e7fc892de","anchor":"ref-94","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[91-df-adequacy-conditions]]"},{"id":"e93fc3e2f8fd50d4","anchor":"ref-18","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[91-df-CT.md]]\n[[91-df-FS-n.md]]\n[[91-df-FS.md]]\n[[91-df-KF-plus.md]]\n[[91-df-KF.md]]\n[[91-df-T-closure.md]]\n[[91-df-T-schema.md]]\n[[91-df-TB-plus.md]]\n[[91-df-TB.md]]\n[[91-df-UTB-plus.md]]\n[[91-df-UTB.md]]\n[[91-df-VF.md]]\n[[91-df-adequacy-conditions-truth.md]]\n[[91-df-adequacy-conditions.md]]\n[[91-df-arithmetical